# ── Personal financial data — MUST NEVER BE COMMITTED ──────────────────────
# This is a public repository. Real ledger exports were sitting untracked in
# the repo root (Monito_All_Time_Backup_*.xls/.csv, ~1 MB of real salary,
# merchants and contact names going back to Feb 2023). A `git add -A` would
# have published them permanently — deleting a file later does not remove it
# from history. Import fixtures for tests belong in e2e/fixtures/, not here.
Monito_*.xls
Monito_*.xlsx
Monito_*.csv
*_All_Time_Backup*.xls
*_All_Time_Backup*.xlsx
*_All_Time_Backup*.csv
# Ledgerly's own exports, which contain the same thing
ledgerly-backup*.json
ledgerly-export*.csv
# Splitwise exports and per-group workbooks used to reconcile the balance
# engine — same problem: real names and real amounts. The reconciliation test
# keeps the arithmetic; the source files stay local.
[Ss]plitwise*.csv
ledgerly-group-*.xlsx

